{{~##
 The one translation unit that carries the reader's implementation.

 The reader is a single header holding both its declarations and its code, behind
 TABBIT_TCB_IMPLEMENTATION, and that macro has to be defined in exactly one
 translation unit. It used to be the generated source file, when there was only one.

 Its own file now rather than whichever generated source happens to be first, so no
 generated .c is quietly special and a consumer who excludes one from their build does not
 lose the reader with it.
##~}}
{{ include 'c-file-head.sbn' }}
#define TABBIT_TCB_IMPLEMENTATION
#include "tabbit/tabbit_tcb_reader.h"
